          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Allergy feature allows the user record, update and retrieve a the list of patient allergies and adverse reactions. Allergy Reference feature allows the user to view detailed information of an allergy, allergy reaction and severity based on the search parameter. Allergy Severity Reference feature allows the user to view detailed information of an allergy, allergy reaction and severity. The Allergy Changed Subscription feature will allow the user to retrieve changes made in the patient's allergy section (generally new or updated and deleted - unless the \u201cDelete (added in error)\u201d checkbox is marked when removing an allergy which will not display any changes). The user will need to subscribe. For more information about subscriptions, please refer to ",
              "marks": [],
